-   ${\mathfrak{R}}_1$: ${\mathcal{S}}_0$ for $k\in{\mathbb{R}}$;

-   ${\mathfrak{R}}_2$: ${\mathcal{S}}_0$ for $k\in(-\infty, V'(u_+^*))$; ${\mathcal{S}}_+$ for $k\in[V'(u_+^*),+\infty)$;

-   ${\mathfrak{R}}_{3a}$: ${\mathcal{S}}_-$ for $k\in(-\infty, V'(u_-^*)]$; ${\mathcal{S}}_0$ for $k\in(V'(u_-^*),+\infty)$;

-   ${\mathfrak{R}}_{3b}$: ${\mathcal{S}}_-$ for $k\in(-\infty, V'(u_-^*)]$; ${\mathcal{S}}_0$ for $k\in(V'(u_-^*),V'(1))$; ${\mathcal{S}}_1$ for $k\in[V'(1),+\infty)$;

